        "id": 7237,
        "name": "Viva Piñata: Party Animals",
        "summary": "A multiplayer game expanding the Viva Pinata experience. Compete in a variety of zany battles and races in the social party game Viva Piñata: Party Animals. Control the fame, fortune, and destiny of all your favorite characters from Viva Piñata: Fergy Fudgehog, Paulie Pretztail, Franklin Fizzlybear, and Hudson Horstachio. It's party time!",
